      "value": "| **ID** | **Date** | **Decision** | **Options Considered** | **Decision Made** | **Rationale** | **Owner** | **Status** |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| DC001 |  | Real-time stock check scope between cart and checkout | Option A: Real-time stock check for all orders between cart and checkout.  Option B: Real-time stock check for time-sensitive fulfilment only (same-day delivery, potentially express and BOPIS where a date commitment is made) | TBC | Option A risks performance impact at checkout. Option B limits real-time check to where it is operationally necessary - where a specific date or time commitment is being made to the customer | @Lucy Fu / @Jasmijn Tsang | OPENYellow |\n| DC002 |  | Images in Contentful or SFCC | 1. Contentful - UI benefits for authoring team, product can be re-used for multiple ways (i.e. not just product), image transformation, DAM workflow, medium integration effort, personalisation 2. SFCC - no integration effort, images only used for product   Recommendation: editorial content in Contentful, product images in SFCC | TBC |  | @Rebecca Jourdan / @Manikandan Ramachandran (Deactivated) | OPENYellow |\n| DC003 |  | DHL Delivery Mode | What details does DHL (and other delivery modes) need to fufill the order e.g. mandatory vs optional | TBC | Need to have accurate shipping data for consignment | Omnichannel Ops team | OPENYellow |\n| DC004 |  | Avalara to confirm setup of Zimm VAT number to country mapping in Salesforce | Eglantine asked Avalara to confirm that the use of either local VAT number vs OSS number should be set up in SALESFORCE |  |  | Avalara ([aishwarya.jagtap@avalara.com](mailto:aishwarya.jagtap@avalara.com)) | OPENYellow |\n| DC005 |  | 8 Storefronts instead of 7 | Zimm prefers to maintain 8 storefronts, keeping US Domestic and US International separate — consistent with the current Magento setup. The technical team agrees with this approach | 8 storefronts | Future proof, same as existing setup | @Manikandan Ramachandran (Deactivated) @Tim Lavelle | DECIDEDGreen |",
